<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Admission Letter - <%= student.fullname %></title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; padding: 40px; background: #f9f9f9; }
    .letter-head { text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px double #000; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
    .letter-head h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 26px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .letter-head p { margin: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; }
    .content { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
    .details-table td { padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #000; }
    .print-btn { background: #0056b3; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; border: none; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px; }
    @media print { .no-print { display: none; } body { padding: 0; background: #fff; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="no-print" style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <button onclick="window.print()" class="print-btn">Print Letter / Save as PDF 🖨️</button>
  </div>

  <div style="background: white; padding: 50px; border: 1px solid #ccc; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div class="letter-head">
      <h1>MAGAZAWA TECHNOLOGY AND SCIENCE</h1>
      <p>OFFICE OF THE REGISTRAR & ADMISSIONS BOARD</p>
      <p>OFFICIAL PROVISIONAL ADMISSION LETTER</p>
    </div>

    <p style="text-align: right;"><strong>Date:</strong> <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %></p>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <strong><%= student.fullname %></strong>,</p>

      <p>We are pleased to inform you that following your application, you have been offered <strong>Provisional Admission</strong> into <strong>MAGAZAWA TECHNOLOGY AND SCIENCE</strong> for the academic program specified below:</p>

      <table class="details-table">
        <tr><td><strong>Registration / Matric Number:</strong></td><td><%= student.reg_no %></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Department / Program:</strong></td><td><%= student.course %></td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Remita RRR Code (Tuition):</strong></td><td><%= student.remita_code %></td></tr>
      </table>

      <p>Please present this letter alongside your payment slip during registration and physical screening upon resumption.</p>

      <p>Congratulations on your admission!</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div>
        <p>___________________________</p>
        <p><strong>Registrar</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <% if(student.passport) { %>
          <img src="/uploads/<%= student.passport %>" style="width: 100px; height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000; object-fit: cover;">
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>